-- title:
--   Gonflement of an Artinian local ring
-- statement:
--   Let $C$ be a commutative ring (in the universe of `Type`) that is local and Artinian. The assertion is the existence of a type $D$ together with a commutative ring structure on it, a local ring structure, the property of being an Artinian ring, and a $C$-algebra structure, such that: $D$ is faithfully flat as a $C$-module; the structure morphism $C \to D$ is a local homomorphism, i.e. it maps the maximal ideal of $C$ into that of $D$ (equivalently, pulls the maximal ideal back to the maximal ideal); the ideal of $D$ generated by the image of $\mathfrak m_C$ is exactly $\mathfrak m_D$, i.e. $\mathfrak m_C D = \mathfrak m_D$; and the residue field $D/\mathfrak m_D$ is algebraically closed. No relation between the residue field of $D$ and an algebraic closure of that of $C$ is recorded in the conclusion beyond algebraic closedness, and no bound on the dimension or length of $D$ is asserted.
--
--   This is the 'gonflement' of an Artinian local ring: every Artinian local ring admits a faithfully flat Artinian local extension, unramified in the sense that the maximal ideal extends to the maximal ideal, whose residue field is algebraically closed. It is used to reduce lifting problems for local Artinian algebras to the case of an algebraically closed residue field, and is cited here in the construction of faithfully flat algebra maps lifting families of homomorphisms from polynomial rings.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_IsArtinianRing_exists_isArtinianRing_faithfullyFlat_map_maximalIdeal_eq_isAlgClosed_residueField.lean

import Mathlib

set_option maxHeartbeats 4000000
set_option synthInstance.maxHeartbeats 400000
set_option backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency.types false

set_option autoImplicit false

open IsLocalRing

theorem IsArtinianRing.exists_isArtinianRing_faithfullyFlat_map_maximalIdeal_eq_isAlgClosed_residueField
    (C : Type) [CommRing C] [IsLocalRing C] [IsArtinianRing C] :
    ∃ (D : Type) (_ : CommRing D) (_ : IsLocalRing D) (_ : IsArtinianRing D) (_ : Algebra C D),
      Module.FaithfullyFlat C D ∧ IsLocalHom (algebraMap C D) ∧
      Ideal.map (algebraMap C D) (maximalIdeal C) = maximalIdeal D ∧
      IsAlgClosed (ResidueField D) := by sorry
